{"id":"vod_md_4164","vodId":"4164","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"小小克星！Refrain","name_cn":"小小克星！Refrain","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230904-1/1d85a6759d7276a5c1d85f9562238acb.jpg"},"summary":"幼时曾深陷绝望深渊的直枝理树，与4位少年少女相遇了。在那之后数年，理树作为Little Busters的一员，喧闹地过着快乐的每一天。这样的时间能够一直持续就好了。理树所期望的只有这样。某日，恭介突然表示要成立一支棒球队伍，理树则开始了寻找成员的任务。在这样的过程中，理树邂逅了新的成员们。和大家一起参加试胆大会，潜入女生宿舍时被换上女装，一起演人偶剧……。经历了许多快乐的事情，同时也在大家的帮助下解决了各自拥有的烦恼。最后在棒球比赛中，理树确认了和最好的朋友们之间的牵绊。——然而，这并不是结束。和来谷唯湖之间的故事。理树与铃的故事。以及，理树和铃终于知晓的“世界的秘密”。Little Busters真正的物语，自此开始——。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-04 08:02:46","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/cerdxlIL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/jwQQ174W/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/39AZli5p/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/pxjjVOSv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/NHRvDoUe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/UFqwBJPK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/UgXz2D4q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230903/OlnP3EAE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230903/a51R2Mt6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230903/OomOqFjJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230903/VoyjKaIx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230903/SdwXILSr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230903/JWDGjPeg/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:07.536Z"}